<p>Focus your shadows on a single target. Friendly targets will be defended for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 9, 10</acronym> turns. Hostile targets will be attacked, with a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74%</acronym> chance the shadows will blindside the target.</p><p>If you have less than maximum shadows available, they will automatically be summoned before focusing.</p><p>This talent has no cost.</p>